snipe: Go code navigation for LLMs.

  snipe index              Build index (run first)
  snipe def ProcessOrder   Jump to definition
  snipe refs ProcessOrder  Find all references
  snipe callers Handler    Who calls this?
  snipe pack ProcessOrder  Everything about a symbol
  snipe search "TODO"      Text search (no index needed)

  snipe doctor             Check index health
  snipe context            Claude-optimized orientation
  snipe context --full     Full architecture dump

Usage:
  snipe [symbol] [flags]
  snipe [command]

Core Commands:
  callees      Find functions that a symbol calls
  callers      Find functions that call a symbol
  def          Jump to symbol definition
  impact       Show blast radius for changing a symbol
  lits         Find all locations of a string literal or env var name
  pack         Full symbol or package profile in a single query
  refs         Find all references to a symbol
  search       Text search via ripgrep
  show         Show symbol details by ID
  sym          Combined symbol query (def + refs + callers + callees)
  tests        Find tests that exercise a symbol
  trace        Trace a string literal through its call context

Index Commands:
  doctor       Check snipe installation and configuration
  index        Build or update the code index
  status       Show index status and statistics

Advanced Commands:
  boundary     Show symbols whose refs cross between two package sets
  context      Generate Claude-optimized project context
  deps         Show dependency topology for a package or the full project
  diagram      Render snipe graphs as D2 diagram source
  edit         AST-aware code editing
  embed-status Check status of batch embedding job
  explain      Structured function explanation for LLMs
  impl         Find types implementing an interface
  importers    Find files that import a package
  imports      Show packages imported by a file
  lifecycle    Trace every function creating, mutating, reading, or deleting a type
  metrics      Show graph metrics (PageRank, coupling, HITS, etc.) over the import or call graph
  pkg          Show package overview with exported symbols
  sim          Semantic similarity search
  types        Show type relationships

Additional Commands:
  help         Help about any command
  version      Print version information

Flags:
      --context int        Context lines around match (default 2)
      --format string      concise | detailed | summary | json | human (default "concise")
  -h, --help               help for snipe
      --kg-hints           Include Orca KG hints
      --limit int          Cap results (default 10)
      --max-tokens int     Token budget (0 = unlimited)
      --no-body            Exclude function body
      --no-siblings        Exclude sibling declarations
      --offset int         Pagination offset
      --select string      Result selection: all, best, top3, top5 (default "all")
      --signature-only     Return only signature (no body, no context)
      --suggestions        Include next-step suggestions in Claude output
      --timeout duration   Timeout for command (e.g., 30s, 5m)

Use "snipe [command] --help" for more information about a command.
